  "reference": "Hosea 5",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 15,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kong’emei tisiik ak bounik Israel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogas nito, ee okwek tisiik, ak koeb it, okwek gotab Israel, ak ogas komie, ee, gotab laitoriat, amu nyonjinok kiruoget; amu kioegu mestet eng’ Mispa, ak mestet ne u regereiywot ne kiitoi eng’ Tabor. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigotes mising’ bistoik barisiet; ago agere kong’ ichek tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angen Epraim, ama ung’at Israel eng’ ane: amu koiyai kugoinatet inye, ee, Epraim, kigong’wanit Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Machamjin ichek boisionikwak koweekyigei Kamuktaindenywa: amu tinyei tamirmirietab kugoinatet, amaingen Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak baoriani menotetab Israel eng’ tainnyi: ibutos anyun Israel ak Epraim eng’ tengektanywa; ibuti Juda agine koboto ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bendi ichek koboto akwotisiekwak che bo kechirek ak che bo tuga, kocheng’ei Jehovah; ago manyoru inendet: kigoistoegei inendet ichek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigoberber Jehovah; amu kigosich lagok che kipsagarek; amei arawet ne kaleel ichek koboto mbarenikwak.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oguut igondit eng’ Gibea, ak oguut iriaget eng’ Rama: owaach eng’ Bet-aben; eng’ ole bo let eng’ inye, ee Benjamin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egu karatia Epraim eng’ betutab keretab kong’: kiaboru eng’ kwenutab bororiosiekab Israel kit ne tun biitu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "U bounikab Juda bik che inaktoe kiwotet: arong’jini ichek neregekyuk ko u beek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisastoe Epraim, kitiekyin ng’ony eng’ kiruoget; amu kichamei kosub ng’atutiet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A u anyun eng’ Epraim kiptorotiot, ak a u nunatet eng’ gotab Juda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kigogeer Epraim miandanyi, ak kogeer Juda ng’otobosiekyik, kwo anyun Epraim Asuria, ak koyokto keguur laitoriat Jareb: ago maimuchi kosoobok, amainyaiywok ng’otobosiekwok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu aigeitu ng’etundo eng’ Epraim, ak aigeitu ng’etundo ne neran eng’ gotab Juda: agereri anendet ak awe; amuti, ama biitu chi ne soru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kong’anyei Israel lelutikwak ak kosigu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aweekyinige anyun oldanyu, agoi kong’any chalwoktanywa, ak kocheng’a: cheng’a eng’ kagiiletab ge eng’ nyalildanywa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.5.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
